; ── ForwardSmash ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Melee Falco FSmash: frame 9, FAF 46. 17% damage — stronger than Fox's 16%.
; BKB=40 gives more guaranteed knockback at low %. Kills ~95% mid-stage.
; The slight vertical component (Angle=50°) makes it harder to DI than Fox's FSmash.
